ur new healthier lifestyle. You'll learn how to optimize your digestion, apply basic kitchen techniques and tips for nutrient-rich foods, and how to grow your own sprouts, and so much more.</p></section><section><picture><source srcset=\"/media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133233452349070000, /media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133233452349070000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133233452349070000, /media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133233452349070000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=330&amp;rnd=133233452349070000, /media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=495&amp;rnd=133233452349070000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=290&amp;rnd=133233452349070000, /media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=133233452349070000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=350&amp;rnd=133233452349070000, /media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=525&amp;rnd=133233452349070000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 576px) and (max-width: 767px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/tcilj4ws/therapists_illu.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=0.66675&amp;width=320&amp;